<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n112205" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">φράγ-μα</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ατος</span>, τό, (<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">φράσσω</span>) <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>fence, breast-work, screen,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Hdt.
				8.52
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Pl.
				<u>Plt.</u>
				279d
			</span></i> (pl.); <i>protection,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τοῖς ἕλκεσι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Gal.
					15.343
				</span></i>
			; <i>boom</i> placed in a harbour, <i><span class="en">
				Aen.Tact.
				37.8
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense4"><b>b.</b> contrivance
			for catching fish, <i><span class="en">
				Str.
				17.2.5
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b> generally,
				<i>defence, means of defence,</i>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">μετώπων φράγματα,</span> of a stag's
			horns, <i><span class="en">
				<u>AP</u>
				6.110
			</span></i> (<i><span class="en">
				Leon.
			</span></i> or <i><span class="en">
				Mnasalc.
			</span></i>); of the ink of the sepia, <i><span class="en">
				Arist.
				<u>PA</u>
				679a6
			</span></i>; of the eyelids, <i><span class="en">
				Id.
				<u>de An.</u>
				421b29
			</span></i>.</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
